I use a piece of software called 2DDesign, it is widely used in UK schools but it has a proprietary file format.

I make the front panels by opening the kicad file making a copy of the pcb, and then place a circle over everything that needs a hole cut. I then export that as a SVG.
2DDesign does take a SVG input so I import it into LibreCad, do the editing and then export that as a .dxf file which will be imported by 2D Design.

